---
title: backup-utilities overlay
---
<h1>Overlay backup-utilities - Backup Utilities</h1>
<p>Provides a small number of tools to back up your data, which basically
means shipping a copy of it somewhere else. See also the @borg overlay.</p>
<p>If you want to back up a database, rather than regular files, look
inside the @postgres-utils overlay.</p>
